{"detail": {"templateUuid": "84695e3ae50c40a89b277be789c49c04", "projectUuid": "8db8cc7fad9445d09d8c788cd4dad49f", "name": "《霸王不别姬》｜从前在峡谷里并肩的人，此时还在你身边吗？", "description": "本片灵感来自王者荣耀中项羽与虞姬的霸王别姬皮肤，也来自许多人年少时在峡谷里并肩作战的记忆。\n戏台上的《霸王别姬》，唱到最后，总逃不过一场离别。现实里的他们，也被命运逼到了“四面楚歌”。男孩的身体渐渐不再听从使唤，再也无法站上那方陪伴他们长大的舞台。可霸王怎能不着蟒扎靠，虞姬又怎会甘愿独舞空台？\n于是，一局游戏、一顶头冠、一声从侧台传来的应和，成了他们与命运交手的另一套“唱念做打”。他不能再陪她站在台上，却依然可以做她的霸王；她独自舞剑，回头时也始终知道，他就在那里。\n这一次，霸王没有别姬。\n大幕会落，戏服会旧，但两颗并肩长大的心，不散场。", "coverUrl": "/assets/3c20c5158833636a.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/e8e7d238dc7649c8bbd167d881f75879/922a036ca2fdafecfe2c441e31e742f96c6c1d93.mp4", "snapshotId": 57395, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 10755851, "ownerUuid": "e8e7d238dc7649c8bbd167d881f75879", "avatar": "/assets/da854d84c852a930.webp", "nickname": "旺喔工作室", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 1, "tags": [{"id": 3063, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "王者无界剧场计划", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3063/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.douyin.com/video/7694244439977004334", "createAt": "2026年10月08日 18:46", "updateAt": "2026年10月08日 23:49", "publishAt": "2026年10月08日 18:46", "playCount": 80, "viewCreationProcessCount": 17, "copyCanvasCount": 1, "shareCount": 1, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/84695e3ae50c40a89b277be789c49c04.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 130, "edges": 212}}, "recommendList": []}